{"scene_id": "pt_enemy_16", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/pdtrain/scenes/pt_enemy_16.fountain", "heading": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "cast": [], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. ENEMY - CONTINUOUS", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you think I am not quite aware of that?", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "My object is precisely not to get it.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "A slight of that kind stimulates a man's fighting power\u2014it is like getting a supply of fresh bile\u2014and I am sure one needs that badly enough in a hole-and-corner place like this, where it is so seldom anything happens to stir one up.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (writing).", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite so, quite so.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, I shall be heard of yet!\u2014Now I shall go and write the appeal to the Householders' Association.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "(Goes into the room on the right.)", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 10, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (sitting al his desk, biting his penholder, says slowly).", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 11, "kind": "action", "text": "Hm!\u2014that's it, is it.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 12, "kind": "action", "text": "(A knock is heard.)", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 13, "kind": "action", "text": "Come in!", "para": 3, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "(PETRA comes in by the outer door.", "para": 3, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "HOVSTAD gets up.)", "para": 3, "sent": 5, "present": []}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "What, you!\u2014here?", "para": 3, "sent": 6, "present": []}, {"u": 17, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, you must forgive me\u2014", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (pulling a chair forward).", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 20, "kind": "action", "text": "Won't you sit down?", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 21, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "No, thank you; I must go again in a moment.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 24, "kind": "action", "text": "Have you come with a message from your father, by any chance?", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 25, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 26, "kind": "action", "text": "No, I have come on my own account.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 27, "kind": "action", "text": "(Takes a book out of her coat pocket.)", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 28, "kind": "action", "text": "Here is the English story.", "para": 8, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Why have you brought it back?", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Because I am not going to translate it.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "But you promised me faithfully.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, but then I had not read it, I don't suppose you have read it either?", "para": 12, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 13, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "No, you know quite well I don't understand English; but\u2014", "para": 13, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 14, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 40, "kind": "action", "text": "Quite so.", "para": 14, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 41, "kind": "action", "text": "That is why I wanted to tell you that you must find something else.", "para": 14, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 42, "kind": "action", "text": "(Lays the book on the table.)", "para": 14, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 43, "kind": "action", "text": "You can't use this for the \"People's Messenger.\"", "para": 14, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 44, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 15, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 45, "kind": "action", "text": "Why not?", "para": 15, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 16, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "Because it conflicts with all your opinions.", "para": 16, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 17, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, for that matter\u2014", "para": 17, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 18, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "You don't understand me.", "para": 18, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "The burden of this story is that there is a supernatural power that looks after the so-called good people in this world and makes everything happen for the best in their case\u2014while all the so-called bad people are punished.", "para": 18, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 53, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 19, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 54, "kind": "action", "text": "Well, but that is all right.", "para": 19, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 55, "kind": "action", "text": "That is just what our readers want.", "para": 19, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 56, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 20, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 57, "kind": "action", "text": "And are you going to be the one to give it to them?", "para": 20, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 58, "kind": "action", "text": "For myself, I do not believe a word of it.", "para": 20, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 59, "kind": "action", "text": "You know quite well that things do not happen so in reality.", "para": 20, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 21, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "You are perfectly right; but an editor cannot always act as he would prefer.", "para": 21, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "He is often obliged to bow to the wishes of the public in unimportant matters.", "para": 21, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "Politics are the most important thing in life\u2014for a newspaper, anyway; and if I want to carry my public with me on the path that leads to liberty and progress, I must not frighten them away.", "para": 21, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "If they find a moral tale of this sort in the serial at the bottom of the page, they will be all the more ready to read what is printed above it; they feel more secure, as it were.", "para": 21, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 22, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "For shame!", "para": 22, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "You would never go and set a snare like that for your readers; you are not a spider!", "para": 22, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 68, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (smiling).", "para": 23, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 69, "kind": "action", "text": "Thank you for having such a good opinion of me.", "para": 23, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 70, "kind": "action", "text": "No; as a matter of fact that is Billing's idea and not mine.", "para": 23, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 71, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 24, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Billing's!", "para": 24, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 25, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes; anyway, he propounded that theory here one day.", "para": 25, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 75, "kind": "action", "text": "And it is Billing who is so anxious to have that story in the paper; I don't know anything about the book.", "para": 25, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 76, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 26, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 77, "kind": "action", "text": "But how can Billing, with his emancipated views\u2014", "para": 26, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 27, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 79, "kind": "action", "text": "Oh, Billing is a many-sided man.", "para": 27, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 80, "kind": "action", "text": "He is applying for the post of secretary to the Bench, too, I hear.", "para": 27, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 81, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 28, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 82, "kind": "action", "text": "I don't believe it, Mr. Hovstad.", "para": 28, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 83, "kind": "action", "text": "How could he possibly bring himself to do such a thing?", "para": 28, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 84, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 29, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 85, "kind": "action", "text": "Ah, you must ask him that.", "para": 29, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 86, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 30, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 87, "kind": "action", "text": "I should never have thought it of him.", "para": 30, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 88, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (looking more closely at her).", "para": 31, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 89, "kind": "action", "text": "No?", "para": 31, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 90, "kind": "action", "text": "Does it really surprise you so much?", "para": 31, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 91, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 32, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 92, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes.", "para": 32, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 93, "kind": "action", "text": "Or perhaps not altogether.", "para": 32, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 94, "kind": "action", "text": "Really, I don't quite know", "para": 32, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 95, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 33, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 96, "kind": "action", "text": "We journalists are not much worth, Miss Stockmann.", "para": 33, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 97, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 34, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 98, "kind": "action", "text": "Do you really mean that?", "para": 34, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 99, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 35, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 100, "kind": "action", "text": "I think so sometimes.", "para": 35, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 101, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 36, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 102, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, in the ordinary affairs of everyday life, perhaps; I can understand that.", "para": 36, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 103, "kind": "action", "text": "But now, when you have taken a weighty matter in hand\u2014", "para": 36, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 104, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 37, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 105, "kind": "action", "text": "This matter of your father's, you mean?", "para": 37, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 106, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 38, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 107, "kind": "action", "text": "Exactly.", "para": 38, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 108, "kind": "action", "text": "It seems to me that now you must feel you are a man worth more than most.", "para": 38, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 109, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 39, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 110, "kind": "action", "text": "Yes, today I do feel something of that sort.", "para": 39, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 111, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 40, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 112, "kind": "action", "text": "Of course you do, don't you?", "para": 40, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 113, "kind": "action", "text": "It is a splendid vocation you have chosen\u2014to smooth the way for the march of unappreciated truths, and new and courageous lines of thought.", "para": 40, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 114, "kind": "action", "text": "If it were nothing more than because you stand fearlessly in the open and take up the cause of an injured man\u2014", "para": 40, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 115, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad.", "para": 41, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 116, "kind": "action", "text": "Especially when that injured man is\u2014ahem!\u2014I don't rightly know how to\u2014", "para": 41, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 117, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra.", "para": 42, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 118, "kind": "action", "text": "When that man is so upright and so honest, you mean?", "para": 42, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 119, "kind": "action", "text": "Hovstad (more gently).", "para": 43, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 120, "kind": "action", "text": "Especially when he is your father I meant.", "para": 43, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 121, "kind": "action", "text": "Petra (suddenly checked).", "para": 44, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 122, "kind": "action", "text": "That?", "para": 44, "sent": 1, "present": []}]}